{"type":"message","id":"ffb27eac","parentId":"2d615f57","timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:21:09.555Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"SYSTEM FAULT RECOVERY: SYNTAX REPAIR\nTARGET: C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\base1_status.ps1\n\nJnr, the health check script you wrote failed during runtime with a PowerShell parsing error: \"The Try statement is missing its Catch or Finally block\" (at line 11, inside the Test-PortOpen function). \n\nWe must enforce clean bracket alignment to preserve our Zero-State compile rule. \n\nOverwrite the existing file with this corrected script immediately:\n\n{\n  \"action\": \"write\",\n  \"path\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\MikeT\\\\Projects\\\\Chief Madithi\\\\base1_status.ps1\",\n  \"writeType\": \"replace\",\n  \"content\": \"# base1_status.ps1\\n# Health check script for Base 1\\n# Checks required directories, ports, and Ollama/qwen2.5 service.\\n\\nfunction Test-PortOpen($port) {\\n    $tcpClient = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.TcpClient\\n    try {\\n        $result = $tcpClient.BeginConnect('127.0.0.1', $port, $null, $null)\\n        $success = $result.AsyncWaitHandle.WaitOne(1000, $false)\\n        if (-not $success) {\\n            return $false\\n        }\\n        $tcpClient.EndConnect($result) | Out-Null\\n        $tcpClient.Close()\\n        return $true\\n    } catch {\\n        return $false\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfunction Test-Ollama {\\n    try {\\n        $response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:11434/api/tags' -TimeoutSec 2 -ErrorAction Stop\\n        return $true\\n    } catch {\\n        return $false\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n# Define required paths (relative to script location)\\n$scriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Definition\\n$requiredPaths = @(\\n    Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\MQL4\\\\Experts',\\n    Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\MQL5\\\\Indicators',\\n    Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\mission-control-app',\\n    Join-Path $scriptDir '.env'\\n)\\n\\nWrite-Host \\\"=== Base 1 Health Check ===\\\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\\n\\n# Check directories/files\\nforeach ($path in $requiredPaths) {\\n    if (Test-Path -Path $path) {\\n        Write-Host \\\"[OK] $path\\\" -ForegroundColor Green\\n    } else {\\n        Write-Host \\\"[FAIL] $path\\\" -ForegroundColor Red\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n# Check ports\\n$portsToCheck = @(18789) # OpenClaw UI\\nforeach ($port in $portsToCheck) {\\n    if (Test-PortOpen -port $port) {\\n        Write-Host \\\"[OK] Port $port listening\\\" -ForegroundColor Green\\n    } else {\\n        Write-Host \\\"[FAIL] Port $port not listening\\\" -ForegroundColor Red\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n# Check Ollama/qwen2.5\\nif (Test-Ollama) {\\n    Write-Host \\\"[OK] Ollama/qwen2.5 service responding\\\" -ForegroundColor Green\\n} else {\\n    Write-Host \\\"[FAIL] Ollama/qwen2.5 not responding\\\" -ForegroundColor Red\\n}\\n\\nWrite-Host \\\"===========================\\\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\\n\"\n}\n\nOnce written, confirm completion. I will trigger the Desktop shortcut to verify.","timestamp":1784118066514,"idempotencyKey":"cf877bb7-136e-471a-9275-1e4410771975:user"}}
{"type":"message","id":"36403168","parentId":"ffb27eac","timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:21:20.338Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-20f1f3da-53db-48ab-894f-42d31c18a720","name":"write","arguments":{"action":"write","path":"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\base1_status.ps1","writeType":"replace","content":"# base1_status.ps1\n# Health check script for Base 1\n# Checks required directories, ports, and Ollama/qwen2.5 service.\n\nfunction Test-PortOpen($port) {\n $tcpClient = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.TcpClient\n try {\n $result = $tcpClient.BeginConnect('127.0.0.1', $port, $null, $null)\n $success = $result.AsyncWaitHandle.WaitOne(1000, $false)\n if (-not $success) {\n return $false\n }\n $tcpClient.EndConnect($result) | Out-Null\n $tcpClient.Close()\n return $true\n } catch {\n return $false\n }\n}\n\nfunction Test-Ollama {\n try {\n $response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:11434/api/tags' -TimeoutSec 2 -ErrorAction Stop\n return $true\n } catch {\n return $false\n }\n}\n\n# Define required paths (relative to script location)\n$scriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Definition\n$requiredPaths = @(\n Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\MQL4\\\\Experts',\n Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\MQL5\\\\Indicators',\n Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\mission-control-app',\n Join-Path $scriptDir '.env'\n)\n\nWrite-Host \"=== Base 1 Health Check ===\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n\n# Check directories/files\nforeach ($path in $requiredPaths) {\n if (Test-Path -Path $path) {\n Write-Host \"[OK] $path\" -ForegroundColor Green\n } else {\n Write-Host \"[FAIL] $path\" -ForegroundColor Red\n }\n}\n\n# Check ports\n$portsToCheck = @(18789) # OpenClaw UI\nforeach ($port in $portsToCheck) {\n if (Test-PortOpen -port $port) {\n Write-Host \"[OK] Port $port listening\" -ForegroundColor Green\n } else {\n Write-Host \"[FAIL] Port $port not listening\" -ForegroundColor Red\n }\n}\n\n# Check Ollama/qwen2.5\nif (Test-Ollama) {\n Write-Host \"[OK] Ollama/qwen2.5 service responding\" -ForegroundColor Green\n} else {\n Write-Host \"[FAIL] Ollama/qwen2.5 not responding\" -ForegroundColor Red\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"===========================\" -ForegroundColor Cyan"},"partialArgs":"{\"action\":\"write\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\MikeT\\\\Projects\\\\Chief Madithi\\\\base1_status.ps1\",\"writeType\":\"replace\",\"content\":\"# base1_status.ps1\\n# Health check script for Base 1\\n# Checks required directories, ports, and Ollama/qwen2.5 service.\\n\\nfunction Test-PortOpen($port) {\\n $tcpClient = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.TcpClient\\n try {\\n $result = $tcpClient.BeginConnect('127.0.0.1', $port, $null, $null)\\n $success = $result.AsyncWaitHandle.WaitOne(1000, $false)\\n if (-not $success) {\\n return $false\\n }\\n $tcpClient.EndConnect($result) | Out-Null\\n $tcpClient.Close()\\n return $true\\n } catch {\\n return $false\\n }\\n}\\n\\nfunction Test-Ollama {\\n try {\\n $response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:11434/api/tags' -TimeoutSec 2 -ErrorAction Stop\\n return $true\\n } catch {\\n return $false\\n }\\n}\\n\\n# Define required paths (relative to script location)\\n$scriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Definition\\n$requiredPaths = @(\\n Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\\\\\..\\\\\\\\..\\\\\\\\MQL4\\\\\\\\Experts',\\n Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\\\\\..\\\\\\\\..\\\\\\\\MQL5\\\\\\\\Indicators',\\n Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\\\\\mission-control-app',\\n Join-Path $scriptDir '.env'\\n)\\n\\nWrite-Host \\\"=== Base 1 Health Check ===\\\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\\n\\n# Check directories/files\\nforeach ($path in $requiredPaths) {\\n if (Test-Path -Path $path) {\\n Write-Host \\\"[OK] $path\\\" -ForegroundColor Green\\n } else {\\n Write-Host \\\"[FAIL] $path\\\" -ForegroundColor Red\\n }\\n}\\n\\n# Check ports\\n$portsToCheck = @(18789) # OpenClaw UI\\nforeach ($port in $portsToCheck) {\\n if (Test-PortOpen -port $port) {\\n Write-Host \\\"[OK] Port $port 