{"type":"message","id":"dcb6ce39","parentId":"10286481","timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:26:56.267Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three guardrails have been implemented and verified on-disk:\n\n1. **Health-check script** – `C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\base1_status.ps1`  \n   - Correctly structured PowerShell with proper try/catch blocks.  \n   - Checks for `.env`, Mission Control app, latest MetaTrader MQL4/MQL5 folders, port 18789, and Ollama/qwen2.5 service.  \n   - Outputs a color-coded status table.\n\n2. **Desktop shortcut** – `C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Desktop\\Base 1 Health Check.lnk`  \n   - Targets `powershell.exe -NoExit -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\base1_status.ps1\"`  \n   - Uses the standard system diagnostic icon (shell32.dll,277).  \n   - Confirmed to exist and launch the script with the console remaining open.\n\n3. **Environment template & gitignore**  \n   - `.env.template` created at `C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\.env.template` with placeholder keys.  \n   - `.gitignore` created at `C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\.gitignore` containing `.env` to prevent accidental commits.\n\n4. **Skill proposal** – `wasp-payload-validator-20260715-0c5b1f5c35` (pending)  \n   - Awaiting your approval via `skill_workshop action=apply proposal_id=wasp-payload-validator-20260715-0c5b1f5c35`.\n\nAll requested artifacts are present and active. You can now double-click the desktop shortcut to run the health check and see the current status of Base 1. Let me know if you’d like to approve the skill, run any further checks, or proceed with additional steps."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784118408342,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7b0