{"type":"message","id":"03c966aa","parentId":"dcb6ce39","timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:31:30.775Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"SYSTEM FAULT RESOLUTION: DEPLOY REPAIRS\nTARGET: Base 1 Environment Status\n\nJnr, we ran the \"Base 1 Health Check\" shortcut and have 4 red failures to clear immediately. Execute these fixes to get our environment to a 100% green baseline.\n\n1. RESOLVE .env (Project)\nCopy the `.env.template` file directly to a new live `.env` file in our workspace so the status check can verify its existence. \n\n2. DYNAMICALLY RESOLVE METATRADER PATHS\nOur relative paths for 'MQL4\\Experts' and 'MQL5\\Indicators' failed because the relative directory depth doesn't match our Base 1 structure. \n- Search common locations on the C: drive (e.g., \"C:\\Program Files\" or AppData) for your MetaTrader installation directory.\n- Update \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\base1_status.ps1\" to use these detected absolute paths. \n- If you cannot find them automatically, rewrite the script to fallback to checking:\n  - \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\MQL4\\Experts\" (or your specific custom path)\n  - \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\MQL5\\Indicators\"\n\n3. RESOLVE OLLAMA SERVICE STATUS\nIf Ollama is not responding, check if the \"ollama.exe\" process is running. Update the health check script so that if Ollama is offline, it attempts to launch the service in the background or clearly outputs the command to start it.\n\nWrite out the updated, fully working \"base1_status.ps1\" and copy the env file. Use the JSON file-write action for the script. \n\nAcknowledge once complete and standing by for a clean health check run.","timestamp":1784118687732,"idempotencyKey":"6e4592e5-fb01-401c-8b65-55f0e041b6ce:user"}}
{"type":"message","id":"90359b54","parentId":"03c966aa","timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:32:04.755Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-94dce1f2-6abb-445d-ba2e-52cd6309b2e3","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Environment variables for Chief Madothi Children's School and Feeding Fund projects\n# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual secrets. Do not commit .env to version control.\n\n# Email/SMTP settings\nSMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com\nSMTP_PORT=587\nSMTP_USER=your_username\nSMTP_PASS=your_password\n\n# API Keys\nALPACA_API_KEY=***\nALPACA_SECRET_KEY=***\nOANDA_API_KEY=***\nOANDA_ACCOUNT_ID=your_oanda_account\n\n# Database (if used)\nDB_HOST=localhost\nDB_PORT=5432\nDB_USER=dbuser\nDB_PASS=dbpassword\nDB_NAME=chief_madothi\n\n# Other services\nSLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/XXX/YYY/ZZZ","path":"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\.env"},"partialArgs":"{\"content\":\"# Environment variables for Chief Madothi Children's School and Feeding Fund projects\\n# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual secrets. Do not commit .env to version control.\\n\\n# Email/SMTP settings\\nSMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com\\nSMTP_PORT=587\\nSMTP_USER=your_username\\nSMTP_PASS=your_password\\n\\n# API Keys\\nALPACA_API_KEY=***\\nALPACA_SECRET_KEY=your_a…cret\\nOANDA_API_KEY=***\\nOANDA_ACCOUNT_ID=your_oanda_account\\n\\n# Database (if used)\\nDB_HOST=localhost\\nDB_PORT=5432\\nDB_USER=dbuser\\nDB_PASS=dbpassword\\nDB_NAME=chief_madothi\\n\\n# Other services\\nSLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/XXX/YYY/ZZZ\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\MikeT\\\\Projects\\\\Chief Madithi\\\\.env\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784118692829,"responseId":"chatcmpl-be719c03-ea84-4230-a4e