{"type":"message","id":"5da797fd","parentId":"35c3a7a2","timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:33:14.797Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-0ca07ab4-6dcf-4355-be95-60aac4dc2f30","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Join-Path : Cannot convert 'System.Object[]' to the type 'System.String' required by parameter 'ChildPath'. Specified \r\n=== Base 1 Health Check ===\n[OK]  .env (Project)\n[OK]  Mission Control App\n[FAIL] MQL4 Experts\n[FAIL] MQL5 Indicators\n[OK]  Port 18789 listening\nmethod is not supported.\r\nAt C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\base1_status.ps1:31 char:50\r\n+         Join-Path -Path $programFiles -ChildPath 'MetaTrader 5',\r\n+                                                  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n    + CategoryInfo          : InvalidArgument: (:) [Join-Path], ParameterBindingException\r\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : CannotConvertArgument,Microsoft.PowerShell.Commands.JoinPathCommand\r\n \r\n[FAIL] Ollama/qwen2.5 not responding\n  Hint: Start Ollama service by running 'ollama serve' in a separate terminal.\n==========================="}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":4066,"aggregated":"Join-Path : Cannot convert 'System.Object[]' to the type 'System.String' required by parameter 'ChildPath'. Specified \r\n=== Base 1 Health Check ===\n[OK]  .env (Project)\n[OK]  Mission Control App\n[FAIL] MQL4 Experts\n[FAIL] MQL5 Indicators\n[OK]  Port 18789 listening\nmethod is not supported.\r\nAt C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\base1_status.ps1:31 char:50\r\n+         Join-Path -Path $programFiles -ChildPath 'MetaTrader 5',\r\n+                                                  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n    + CategoryInfo          : InvalidArgument: (:) [Join-Path], ParameterBindingException\r\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : CannotConvertArgument,Microsoft.PowerShell.Commands.JoinPathCommand\r\n \r\n[FAIL] Ollama/qwen2.5 not responding\n  Hint: Start Ollama service by running 'ollama serve' in a separat