{"type":"message","id":"550a5eb4","parentId":"a399dc02","timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:39:22.331Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"SYSTEM REBOOT: STRICT TARGET FOCUS\nAPPLY TO: ALL ACTIVE BASE 1 CHATS\nPROJECT BOUNDARY: REMOVE ALL TRADING/METATRADER REFERENCES\n\nJnr, execute an immediate \"ALL STOP\" on any trading, brokerage, MetaTrader, or MQL4/MQL5 integrations. We are focusing solely on the core Base 1 platform and our top-tier agent infrastructure.\n\nOverwrite \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\base1_status.ps1\" to remove the MQL4/MQL5 path checks entirely. It must only monitor our core project directories, native server ports, and local models.\n\n{\n  \"action\": \"write\",\n  \"path\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\MikeT\\\\Projects\\\\Chief Madithi\\\\base1_status.ps1\",\n  \"writeType\": \"replace\",\n  \"content\": \"# base1_status.ps1\\n# Core health check script for Base 1 (Platform Focus)\\n\\nfunction Test-PortOpen($port) {\\n    $tcpClient = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.TcpClient\\n    try {\\n        $result = $tcpClient.BeginConnect('127.0.0.1', $port, $null, $null)\\n        $success = $result.AsyncWaitHandle.WaitOne(1000, $false)\\n        if (-not $success) {\\n            return $false\\n        }\\n        $tcpClient.EndConnect($result) | Out-Null\\n        $tcpClient.Close()\\n        return $true\\n    } catch {\\n        return $false\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfunction Test-Ollama {\\n    try {\\n        $response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:11434/api/tags' -TimeoutSec 2 -ErrorAction Stop\\n        return $true\\n    } catch {\\n        return $false\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n$scriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Definition\\n\\n# Strictly core workspace paths only\\n$requiredPaths = @(\\n    Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\mission-control-app',\\n    Join-Path $scriptDir '.env'\\n)\\n\\nWrite-Host \\\"=== Base 1 Health Check ===\\\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\\n\\n# Check directories/files\\nforeach ($path in $requiredPaths) {\\n    if (Test-Path -Path $path) {\\n        Write-Host \\\"[OK] $path\\\" -ForegroundColor Green\\n    } else {\\n        Write-Host \\\"[FAIL] $path\\\" -ForegroundColor Red\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n# Check ports\\n$portsToCheck = @(18789) # OpenClaw UI\\nforeach ($port in $portsToCheck) {\\n    if (Test-PortOpen -port $port) {\\n        Write-Host \\\"[OK] Port $port listening\\\" -ForegroundColor Green\\n    } else {\\n        Write-Host \\\"[FAIL] Port $port not listening\\\" -ForegroundColor Red\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n# Check Ollama/qwen2.5\\nif (Test-Ollama) {\\n    Write-Host \\\"[OK] Ollama/qwen2.5 service responding\\\" -ForegroundColor Green\\n} else {\\n    Write-Host \\\"[FAIL] Ollama/qwen2.5 not responding\\\" -ForegroundColor Red\\n}\\n\\nWrite-Host \\\"===========================\\\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\\n\"\n}\n\nVerify the write, do not attempt automatic system execution, and confirm once complete.","timestamp":1784119159261,"idempotencyKey":"9f447bc6-bdee-406c-9990-d166837c7b6d:user"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a54ad698","parentId":"550a5eb4","timestamp":"2026-07-15T12:39:35.780Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-eb821241-171c-4d8f-8836-efaca174b5f9","name":"write","arguments":{"writeType":"replace","action":"write","content":"# base1_status.ps1\n# Core health check script for Base 1 (Platform Focus)\n\nfunction Test-PortOpen($port) {\n $tcpClient = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.TcpClient\n try {\n $result = $tcpClient.BeginConnect('127.0.0.1', $port, $null, $null)\n $success = $result.AsyncWaitHandle.WaitOne(1000, $false)\n if (-not $success) {\n return $false\n }\n $tcpClient.EndConnect($result) | Out-Null\n $tcpClient.Close()\n return $true\n } catch {\n return $false\n }\n}\n\nfunction Test-Ollama {\n try {\n $response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:11434/api/tags' -TimeoutSec 2 -ErrorAction Stop\n return $true\n } catch {\n return $false\n }\n}\n\n$scriptDir = Split-Path -Parent $MyInvocation.MyCommand.Definition\n\n# Strictly core workspace paths only\n$requiredPaths = @(\n Join-Path $scriptDir '..\\\\mission-control-app',\n Join-Path $scriptDir '.env'\n)\n\nWrite-Host \"=== Base 1 Health Check ===\" -ForegroundColor Cyan\n\n# Check directories/files\nforeach ($path in $requiredPaths) {\n if (Test-Path -Path $path) {\n Write-Host \"[OK] $path\" -ForegroundColor Green\n } else {\n Write-Host \"[FAIL] $path\" -ForegroundColor Red\n }\n}\n\n# Check ports\n$portsToCheck = @(18789) # OpenClaw UI\nforeach ($port in $portsToCheck) {\n if (Test-PortOpen -port $port) {\n Write-Host \"[OK] Port $port listening\" -ForegroundColor Green\n } else {\n Write-Host \"[FAIL] Port $port not listening\" -ForegroundColor Red\n }\n}\n\n# Check Ollama/qwen2.5\nif (Test-Ollama) {\n Write-Host \"[OK] Ollama/qwen2.5 service responding\" -ForegroundColor Green\n} else {\n Write-Host \"[FAIL] Ollama/qwen2.5 not responding\" -ForegroundColor Red\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"===========================\" -ForegroundColor Cyan","path"