{"type":"message","id":"2db63d23","parentId":"a655f000","timestamp":"2026-07-15T13:56:53.150Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"SYSTEM RE-ARCHITECT: THE 6-PILLAR WASP INTEL NET\nTARGET: C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\research_ollama.ps1\n\nJnr, we are expanding our focus to a tight, comprehensive 6-Pillar Intelligence Net. This completes the roadmap. We are targeting these specific channels to harvest our strategic nuggets:\n\n1. Julian Goldie (Programmatic SEO, automated traffic, search rankings)\n2. Kris Harrison / All About AI (Local Python agents, private databases, offline workflows)\n3. Alex Finn (Mission Control custom dashboards, task boards, and active workspace UI)\n4. The Rumers (Doug - Pure 15-minute range trading strategies)\n5. The Secret Mindset (Smart Money institutional order block and liquidity mechanics)\n6. Greg Isenberg (AI monetization, builder-distributor loops, micro-communities, and making money online)\n\nExecute these deployment steps:\n\n1. WORKSPACE ARCHIVE:\n   - Create the directory \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\archive\\\" if it does not exist.\n   - Move \"outbound_queue.json\", \"outreach_engine.js\", and \"sourced_leads.json\" into that archive folder.\n   - Apply and activate our pending validator skill:\n     skill_workshop action=apply proposal_id=wasp-payload-validator-20260715-0c5b1f5c35\n\n2. WRITE THE 6-PILLAR FILTERING SCRIPT:\n   Write \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\research_ollama.ps1\".\n   - It must query local Ollama (qwen2.5) on port 11434.\n   - It must run our strict \"WASP System Judge\" prompt, filtering out general tech fluff and ONLY keeping actionable nuggets that directly improve:\n     - Local Base 1 optimization or UI improvements.\n     - Automated SEO, lead generation, and distribution.\n     - Specific range trading strategy or smart money concepts.\n     - Modern online business models and high-leverage monetization loops.\n   - If a nugget passes, it must append a clean 2-3 sentence technical briefing to \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\Chief Madithi\\research_brief.md\".\n\n3. REGISTER THE CRON JOB:\n   Register the background task using the OpenClaw cron tool to run \"research_ollama.ps1\" every 4 hours.\n\nDo not run the script automatically in your terminal. Acknowledge once written and registered, and I will manually invoke the script to verify.","timestamp":1784123809945,"idempotencyKey":"b34f4b80-2d4f-42e6-99ba-4a9cd4eeea1b:user"}}
