cal models. It uses local file paths instead of complex cloud databases to keep user data 100% secure and offline on the local network.\\\"\\n$judgePrompt = @\\\"\\nYou are the WASP System Judge. Extract ONLY actionable, high-leverage nuggets that improve:\\n1. Local Base 1 optimization/UI (performance, automation, dashboards).\\n2. Automated SEO, lead gen, distribution (programmatic SEO, traffic, outreach).\\n3. Specific range trading/smart money (15‑min range, order blocks, liquidity sweeps, institutional footprints).\\n4. Online business models/high‑leverage monetization (AI monetization, builder‑distributor, micro‑communities, profit‑share).\\nIgnore general tech/news without concrete, implementable insight.\\nFor each chunk, reply with exactly one line:\\n- If qualifies: ACCEPT: <2‑3 sentence technical summary>\\n- Else: REJECT\\nNo extra text.\\n\\\"@\\n$payload = @{ model = \\\"qwen2.5-coder:7b\\\"; prompt = $judgePrompt + \\\"`n\\\" + $chunk; stream = $false } | ConvertTo-Json\\n$response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:11434/api/generate' -Method Post -Body $payload -ContentType 'application/json' -TimeoutSec 60\\n$response.response\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784130353215,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9807c214-1a36-4523-a9b4-99e47d07ca14"}}
